# Vanilla Minecraft Axe Head - Accurate mesh model
# Based on axe.json weapon profile
# All coordinates in centimeters
# Axe head oriented PERPENDICULAR to handle
# Eye: 300mm length (30cm), 100mm height (10cm), 15mm thickness (1.5cm)
# Cheek: 300mm (30cm) extending from eye
# Beard/Toe: 50mm (5cm) extra height, 150mm (15cm) tip distance
# 
# Coordinate system for perpendicular head:
# - X-axis: along the cutting edge direction (primary axis)
# - Y-axis: handle direction (when attached, extends up from handle)
# - Z-axis: thickness direction
# - Origin: center of eye hole where handle passes through

# The axe head is modeled as viewed from above (looking down -Y axis)
# with the cutting edge on the +X side and the poll (back) on -X side

# ==============================================================
# EYE SECTION (where handle passes through)
# ==============================================================

# Eye outer boundary - rectangular with eye hole
# Eye dimensions: 30cm long (Y), 10cm tall (height along X), 1.5cm thick (Z)

# Eye back edge (poll side, -X)
v -5.0 -15.0 0.75
v -5.0 -15.0 -0.75
v -5.0 15.0 0.75
v -5.0 15.0 -0.75

# Eye front edge (blade side, +X, before cheek starts)
v 5.0 -15.0 0.75
v 5.0 -15.0 -0.75
v 5.0 15.0 0.75
v 5.0 15.0 -0.75

# ==============================================================
# CHEEK SECTION (tapers toward cutting edge)
# Cheek extends 30cm from eye toward cutting edge
# ==============================================================

# Cheek at 1/3 distance (10cm from eye edge)
# Width narrows from 30cm to about 25cm, thickness thins slightly
v 15.0 -12.5 0.6
v 15.0 -12.5 -0.6
v 15.0 12.5 0.6
v 15.0 12.5 -0.6

# Cheek at 2/3 distance (20cm from eye edge)  
# Continuing to narrow
v 25.0 -10.0 0.4
v 25.0 -10.0 -0.4
v 25.0 10.0 0.4
v 25.0 10.0 -0.4

# ==============================================================
# CUTTING EDGE with Beard and Toe
# Edge at 30cm from eye, with beard (-Y extension) and toe (+Y extension)
# Beard: 5cm extra height, 15cm tip distance from main edge
# Toe: 5cm extra height, 15cm tip distance from main edge
# ==============================================================

# Main cutting edge at cheek end (before beard/toe)
v 35.0 -10.0 0.0
v 35.0 10.0 0.0

# Beard tip (extends down and slightly forward)
# Beard goes 15cm past main edge in X, and 5cm extra down in Y
v 50.0 -15.0 0.0

# Toe tip (extends up and slightly forward)
# Toe goes 15cm past main edge in X, and 5cm extra up in Y
v 50.0 15.0 0.0

# ==============================================================
# POLL (back of axe head for striking)
# Extends slightly past the eye on the -X side
# ==============================================================

# Poll face (flat back for striking)
v -8.0 -12.0 0.6
v -8.0 -12.0 -0.6
v -8.0 12.0 0.6
v -8.0 12.0 -0.6

# ==============================================================
# FACES (triangles, CCW winding for outward normals)
# ==============================================================

# ---- POLL (back striking surface) ----
f 21 23 24
f 21 24 22

# ---- POLL to EYE BACK transition ----
# Top face
f 23 3 4
f 23 4 24
# Bottom face
f 21 22 2
f 21 2 1
# Front side (+Z)
f 21 1 3
f 21 3 23
# Back side (-Z)
f 22 24 4
f 22 4 2

# ---- EYE SECTION outer surfaces ----
# Top face of eye
f 3 7 8
f 3 8 4
# Bottom face of eye
f 1 2 6
f 1 6 5
# Front side of eye (+Z)
f 1 5 7
f 1 7 3
# Back side of eye (-Z)
f 2 4 8
f 2 8 6

# ---- EYE to CHEEK 1/3 ----
# Top transition
f 7 11 12
f 7 12 8
# Bottom transition
f 5 6 10
f 5 10 9
# Front side (+Z)
f 5 9 11
f 5 11 7
# Back side (-Z)
f 6 8 12
f 6 12 10

# ---- CHEEK 1/3 to 2/3 ----
# Top
f 11 15 16
f 11 16 12
# Bottom
f 9 10 14
f 9 14 13
# Front (+Z)
f 9 13 15
f 9 15 11
# Back (-Z)
f 10 12 16
f 10 16 14

# ---- CHEEK 2/3 to CUTTING EDGE ----
# Top (toward toe)
f 15 18 16
# Bottom (toward beard)
f 13 14 17
# Front (+Z) - converges to edge
f 13 17 18
f 13 18 15
# Back (-Z) - converges to edge
f 14 16 18
f 14 18 17

# ---- BEARD (lower extension of cutting edge) ----
# Beard face (triangular from edge bottom to beard tip)
f 17 19 13
f 14 19 17
f 13 19 14

# ---- TOE (upper extension of cutting edge) ----
# Toe face (triangular from edge top to toe tip)
f 18 15 20
f 18 20 16
f 15 16 20
